From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] EasyMesh: show authoritative backhaul band and channel

Expose current operating-channel data in the BSS and STA inventory trees and
persist updates received through Operating Channel Report. During the startup
window before such a report is available, derive a colocated Agent link channel
from the live kernel radio state, cached for five seconds.

Display backhaul labels as band plus channel, keep client signal values in hover
details, and fit a completed optimized layout before applying a deferred refresh
so the two-second poll cannot cause a second zoom jump.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [RDK-B lab WebUI and local fallback]
